      "content": "$$u = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} u_y d\\nu = A \\cdot \\frac{48\\pi h}{c^3} \\left(\\frac{kT}{h}\\right)^4 \\sum_{1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{p^4}$$",
