      "content": "$$\\begin{array}{l} dS = \\frac{1}{T} [d(uV) + PdV] = V \\frac{du}{T} + (u + P) \\frac{dV}{T} \\quad (V \\text{ volume total}) \\\\ = \\frac{V}{T} \\frac{du}{dT} dT + \\frac{4}{3} u \\frac{dV}{T} \\end{array}$$",
